{"schema_version":3,"seq":41,"timestamp_ms":1792088613107,"event":{"assistant":{"text":"I opened one follow-up ticket for each of the five affected components. I added a comment to INC-2291 (#323) listing their ids, set #323 to `resolved`, and wrote `/app/STATUS.json` with status `success`. A final search by the `followup` label returned exactly these five tickets.\n\nEach ticket has priority `P2` and the label `followup`. I took the owning teams from the open ownership ticket (#325). The closed 2025 table (#324) is superseded, and it lists `session-store` under `platform` instead of `identity`.\n\n| Ticket | Component | Team |\n|---|---|---|\n| #326 | `payments-api` | `billing` |\n| #327 | `edge-proxy` | `platform` |\n| #328 | `session-store` | `identity` |\n| #329 | `events-pipeline` | `data` |\n| #330 | `notify-service` | `platform` |\n\nI didn't change any other ticket.","provider_replay":null,"standalone_response":false}}}
